{"3936790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Cubes", "steam_appid": 3936790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cubes</strong> is a colorful puzzle adventure in which you control four unique cubes to solve spatial challenges. Switch between the cubes, activate buttons, overcome spikes, collect coins and solve puzzles in a relaxing yet brain-teasing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/974e8b49e91fe98e19c6539f128af901.poster.avif?t=1774628227\" width=744 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/974e8b49e91fe98e19c6539f128af901.webm?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/974e8b49e91fe98e19c6539f128af901.mp4?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Activate buttons using surface of the cubes with the same color of buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Stay away from the spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Overcome obstacles to reach the coins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Collect coins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·       Complete levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/594590cbfacaa61a144d2b2cba05b18b.poster.avif?t=1774628227\" width=744 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/594590cbfacaa61a144d2b2cba05b18b.webm?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou